bout as close as it's gonna get because  you're not gonna be able to match  functionality of android l and android m  with all the stuff you get with touchwiz  even though these features are nice  they're not as pretty so the theme sort  of makes that better so there you have  it uh if you enjoyed it feel free to  give this video a thumbs up and if you  want to see more videos sort of like  this then leave a thumbs up or a comment  down below to let me know either way  that's been it thanks for watching and  i'll talk to you guys in the next one  peace
 

